# ROOter vendored feeds are TRACKED, not ignored: feeds/{luci,packages,routing,
# telephony,video} + their .index/.targetindex/.tmp, the feeds/base symlink
# (-> ../package), and the package/feeds/ symlink tree. feeds.conf stays
# untracked (matches upstream OpenWrt + source2410); make never reads it.
/feeds.conf

# A feed added as an absolute link to a local mirror is not portable: the
# clone gets a dangling symlink. Vendored feeds are tracked as real files
# instead (see feeds/zapret2), so anything under feeds/ that is still a
# link to a path outside the tree is a leftover.
/feeds/tailscale

# ROOter build outputs: the per-model sysupgrade zips are produced by ./build
# (tree root) and copied into images/ by buildz8. Keep images/ tracked so
# images/placeholder survives, but ignore the zips themselves.
/ZBT-*.zip
/images/*.zip
